{#- Written directly rather than through ansible.builtin.deb822_repository.
    That module needs python3-debian on the node, and installing it needs apt
    to refresh — which fails while this very file still points somewhere
    broken. The module cannot fix a repository whose brokenness stops it from
    being installed. A template has no such circle: the file is corrected
    first, and only then does anything touch apt.

    Angie publishes per distribution version with the codename as the suite:
    .../angie/ubuntu/26.04 with Suites: resolute. -#}
